### Create emp
POST http://localhost:4000/emp-api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"nigama",
    "email":"nigama@mail.com",
    "mobile":9999999,
    "designation":"developer",
    "companyName":"tcs"
}

### Read all emps
GET http://localhost:4000/emp-api/employees

### Update emp by id
PUT http://localhost:4000/emp-api/employees/6a00c918ee1f380243baad85
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"ravi",
    "email":"ravikumar@mail.com",
    "mobile":1111111,
    "designation":"developer",
    "companyName":"cts"
}

### Delete emp by id
DELETE http://localhost:4000/emp-api/employees/6a00c9a7ee1f380243baad89